  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EFplV8U.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"3208\" height=\"1000\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/852146?style=for-the-badge&logo=Curseforge&color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"177\" height=\"28\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fcGPE3mktFe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1141743994154528768?style=for-the-badge&logo=Discord&label=MineColonies: Dimensional Adventure&color=FF0000&link=https://discord.com/invite/cGPE3mktFe\" alt=\"\" width=\"430\" height=\"29\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong>我的项目</strong></em></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/minecolonies-dimensional-adventure-re-blueprinted\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MineColonies: Dimensional Adventure [蓝图重制版] 点击此处</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloche-creations\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/979514?style=for-the-badge&logo=Curseforge&label=Cloche Creations&color=FF0000&link=https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloche-creations\" alt=\"\" width=\"223\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcloche-creations\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/mbekts9X?style=for-the-badge&logo=Modrinth&label=Cloche Creations&color=FF0000&link=https://modrinth.com/mod/cloche-creations\" alt=\"\" width=\"214\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1098989?style=for-the-badge&logo=Curseforge&label=MineColonies: Block Party&color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"262\" height=\"28\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/wdfIaSqz?style=for-the-badge&logo=Modrinth&label=MineColonies: Block Party&color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"254\" height=\"26\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/985671?style=for-the-badge&logo=Curseforge&label=Tinted Grass&color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ftinted-grass%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/ZwO3amOU?style=for-the-badge&logo=Modrinth&label=Tinted Grass&color=FF0000&link=https://modrinth.com/mod/tinted-grass/\" alt=\"\" width=\"173\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/994223?style=for-the-badge&logo=Curseforge&label=Tinted Torches&color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"207\" height=\"28\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/mc1hqaaO?style=for-the-badge&logo=Modrinth&label=Tinted Torches&color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"197\" height=\"28\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1009078?style=for-the-badge&logo=Curseforge&label=Tinted Dyes&color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"172\" height=\"28\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/77VVvOOe?style=for-the-badge&logo=Modrinth&label=Tinted Dyes&color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"172\" height=\"28\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1037808?style=for-the-badge&logo=Curseforge&label=Tinted Sands&color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"174\" height=\"28\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/d72EAPUQ?style=for-the-badge&logo=Modrinth&label=Tinted Sands&color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"165\" height=\"28\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1164785?style=for-the-badge&logo=Curseforge&label=Tinted Planks&color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"187\" height=\"28\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/rDPwULcT?style=for-the-badge&logo=Modrinth&label=Tinted Planks&color=FF0000\" alt=\"\" width=\"179\" height=\"28\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong>*免责声明*</strong></em></span></p>\n<p>本整合包目前处于&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><em>活跃开发中。</em></strong></span>虽然可以完整游玩，但在其生命周期内可能会出现各种漏洞和改动，因为我会不断调整以符合自己的构想。（如有误解，非常抱歉！！！）</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong>本整合包与 MineColonies 开发团队或其任何官方 MineColonies 整合包均无正式关联。</strong></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong>遇到问题时，请勿向他们寻求关于本整合包的故障排除支持!!!!</strong></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong>以上就是全部内容！</strong></em></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong>此外，使用 TLauncher 将无法获得我和开发团队的任何支持。请购买正版游戏!!!!</strong></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong>ATLauncher 与 GDLauncher 在本整合包中运行异常，请考虑使用 CurseForge 或 Prism Launcher！</strong></em></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>为了您的安全，请仅从 CurseForge 下载本整合包。</p>\n<p>本项目仅在 CurseForge 上发布。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/igt8rYA.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"3208\" height=\"350\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;在《MineColonies: Dimensional Adventure》中开启创造与探索的世界。本整合包将你的 Minecraft 体验从单纯的建造提升到编织故事、发展社区以及开辟属于自己独特旅程的高度。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;作为你领地的建筑师，请逐块为殖民地注入生机。让你的城镇充满活力，每个角落都回荡着你亲手创造的生命气息。但别太安逸了！在城镇温馨的小巷之外，还有未探索的维度、阴森的地下城和遥远的星球，正等待勇敢的探险者揭开它们的神秘面纱。《MineColonies: Dimensional Adventure》不仅仅关乎单人冒险。与好友或整个社区携手合作，共同分享创造与探索的激动人心吧。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1GTzwbv.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"3208\" height=\"350\"></p>\n<p><br><strong>动态 NPC</strong>：体验一座生机勃勃的城镇，拥有建造者、工匠、农夫、渔民、守卫、矿工、冶炼师、面包师、厨师、快递员、畜牧师等多种 NPC！<br><strong>特色建筑</strong>：建造仓库、公民小屋和市政厅等核心建筑，让你的殖民地独具特色。<br><strong>众多维度</strong>：踏上跨越多个维度的旅程，每个维度都提供独特的冒险与资源。<br><strong>多样地下城</strong>：探索一系列充满挑战的地下城，其中蕴藏着隐藏宝藏与凶猛敌人。<br><strong>丰富的建材</strong>：凭借海量建材，打造你梦想中的基地。<br><strong>安防设备</strong>：利用先进的安防设备保护你辛苦建设的基地免受怪物侵扰。<br><strong>科技盛宴</strong>：借助 Mekanism、Immersive Engineering 和 Applied Energistics 等模组，深入先进科技世界。<br><strong>飞艇与太空探索</strong>：乘坐优雅的飞艇翱翔天际，或深入宇宙去发现并征服新星球。<br><strong>多样化农业</strong>：种植各类作物以供养市民，维持不断壮大的殖民地。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/QzeIzFU.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"3208\" height=\"350\"></p>\n<p><br style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;我们打造《MineColonies: Dimensional Adventure》的愿景是为大家提供一个友好且充满乐趣的整合包。我们相信选择的力量与创造的激情。我们致力于打造一个让你能够建造复杂机械、建立城镇、踏上宏大冒险并书写自己故事的环境。冒险由你主宰，唯一的限制就是你的想象力。欢迎来到属于你的维度冒险！</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/aMuYvNz.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"3208\" height=\"350\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><del>E4MC 已预装于整合包中，玩家无需任何配置即可轻松加入好友的单人世界。只需启动整合包，邀请你的朋友，一起开始构建属于你的维度冒险。</del></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>我们目前正在寻找该功能的更佳替代方案。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>（迟来的感谢）非常感谢大家一直支持我和我的整合包，并帮助它突破 120 万次下载。我实在难以置信。我从未想过能走到今天这一步。你们真的太棒了!!!!!&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>官方 Discord：<strong>请点击&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>问题反馈标签页</strong></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>服务器整合包：<strong>正式发布</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>1.21：&nbsp;<strong>活跃开发中</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>1.12.2 以下的版本将不会再制作。抱歉。</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>所有模组版权归其各自作者所有。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>遇到特定模组问题时，请始终考虑向对应作者反馈。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>问题与反馈可发布于 Discord 频道。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
